  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">COOPRORIZ Abahuzabikorwa - Harvest Management for livelihood improvement</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Rice..Beneficiaries: 2750 (1650 women)..Description: Group members seek to improve post-harvest infrastructure and equipment to reduce losses and improve quality. These include drying yards warehouses and toilets in each production zone, and acquisition of threshers, as well as training in improved fertilizer use to increase overall production...</narrative>
